      <title>Merseyrail expands Tap &amp;amp; Go system</title>
      <link>https://www.railadvent.co.uk/2026/02/new-easier-to-use-era-starts-on-merseyrail-as-tap-go-extended-to-bank-cards-watches-and-smartphones.html</link>
      <description>A new era of travel has begun across the Merseyrail network with the expansion of Tap &amp;amp; Go to include contactless bank cards, smartphones and smartwatches. The initiative, backed by a £10m investment from Steve Rotherham and the Liverpool City Region Combined Authority, aims to modernise the region’s transport system and improve convenience for passengers.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.railadvent.co.uk/2026/02/new-easier-to-use-era-starts-on-merseyrail-as-tap-go-extended-to-bank-cards-watches-and-smartphones.html</guid>
