    <item>
      <title>Tyne and Wear Metro welcomes delivery of final class 555 trains</title>
      <link>https://www.railadvent.co.uk/2026/02/nexus-takes-delivery-of-all-46-new-stadler-metro-trains.html</link>
      <description>All 46 new Tyne and Wear Metro trains have now been delivered, marking a significant milestone in the £362 million fleet renewal programme led by Nexus. The final train arrived at the Gosforth depot in the early hours of 21 February, completing the order built by Swiss manufacturer Stadler.</description>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.railadvent.co.uk/2026/02/nexus-takes-delivery-of-all-46-new-stadler-metro-trains.html</guid>
